# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GitHub holds ONLY the minimum needed to build/deploy the app to Netlify and
# Northflank. Everything below stays on local disk but is NOT tracked:
#   - docs, dev guides, scripts/tooling
#   - SQL / Supabase (migrations are produced here but applied as a separate
#     manual activity — the build process must never touch the database)
#   - CI / GitHub Actions automation
#   - tests and type-check configs (run locally before pushing)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# DB / Supabase — never on GitHub
/supabase/
/backups/

# Docs & dev guides
/docs/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE_general_dev_rules.md

# Dev tooling / scripts
/scripts/

# CI / automation
/.github/

# Tests & type-check configs (local-only; not needed to deploy)
*.test.js
*.spec.js
vitest.config.js
jsconfig.json
tsconfig.check.json

# Env example / reference
.env.example
.env.example_with_debug

# Misc
.gitmodules
